If you find a Trobriand Islander trained in Nyaya-Vaisheshika metaphysics a=
nd Neo-Platonism, I suppose the Dog sense would be intelligible, otherwise,=
 probably not. None of xorxes, &, or me has ever made it make sense.

Tenses can be used as tags and even interpreted in their normal use as such=
, but that does not mean -- I don't think -- that BAI, normal tags, can be =
used as "tenses".=A0 I wouldn't have thought of English "so" as comparative=
 all on its own, but merely an intensifier.=A0 But, on the other hand, I do=
n't know how to say this "so (oooo)" in Lojban otherwise (I was thinking of=
 gliding on the /o/ of {ci'omle} as the reason for preferring it to {citmle=
}).

"Compositionality only gets one so far."=A0 Lord, how I wish Logjammers wou=
ld take that to heart.

If folks understand Dog, then they should get "the relevant chunk/avatar of=
 Dog".



